# Security headers for every file the Worker serves from static assets (security audit M5). Cloudflare applies this
# file to asset responses only; API responses get theirs in apps/api/src/app.ts.
# Why each loose part of the Content-Security-Policy is there:
# - style-src 'unsafe-inline': React style={…} attributes are used throughout.
# - img-src https:: radio station icons, Strava and Google profile photos come from arbitrary hosts.
# - media-src https: / connect-src https:: radio and TV streams; hls.js downloads playlists and segments with fetch.
#   Firebase Auth and the elevation tile hosts (apps/web/src/realroad/dem.ts) are covered by https:.
# - media-src http:: some radio stations only stream over http; the player loads them today and must keep doing so
#   (found in the browser check, 2026-11-15). Media only — never scripts.
# - worker-src blob:: hls.js runs its worker from a blob.
# - script-src https://apis.google.com/js/api.js https://apis.google.com/_/scs/ and frame-src <project>.firebaseapp.com:
#   Firebase's "Continue with Google" pop-up loads Google's API loader (js/api.js), which loads its parts from _/scs/,
#   and talks to the pop-up through a hidden frame on the auth domain. Only those two paths: the whole host serves
#   endpoints that return script, a known way around a policy (security audit 2, V9).
# - Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy same-origin-allow-popups: other sites' windows get no handle on this one; the Google
#   pop-up can still report back.
# The value of this policy is script-src 'self' (no injected or third-party script can run) and frame-ancestors 'none'.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), bluetooth=(self)
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://apis.google.com/js/api.js https://apis.google.com/_/scs/; frame-src https://myfitbike-d5722.firebaseapp.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data:; media-src 'self' blob: https: http:; connect-src 'self' https:; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'
